Package: CSIRWLS
Type: Package
Title: Censored Sliced Inverse Regression based on  withWeighted Leverage Scores
     (CSIR-WLS)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Nadia", "Asrir", email = "n.asrir@ump.ac.ma",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements CSIR-WLS, a dimension-reduction method for
    censored survival data that combines Censored Sliced Inverse
    Regression (CSIR) with aWeighted Leverage Scores (WLS) leverage-score
    variable selection step for the high-dimensional setting. Also
    bundles the competing methods used for comparison in the associated
    paper (SIR, Cox, CSIS, DCSIS, SIRS, SIS), simulation-data generators,
    evaluation metrics, parallel Monte-Carlo simulation runners, and
    LaTeX table helpers used to reproduce the paper's tables and figures.
